(Expense Tracking Application - Project Workflow) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(Project Overview) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(The Expense Tracking Application is a full-stack web application built with React.js) Tj
T*
(and Java Spring Boot. It allows users to register, log in, manage income and) Tj
T*
(expenses, organize transactions by category, view dashboard summaries, filter) Tj
T*
(records, and generate reports.) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(High-Level Architecture Workflow) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(User) Tj
T*
(  -> React Frontend) Tj
T*
(  -> Spring Boot REST API) Tj
T*
(  -> Service Layer) Tj
T*
(  -> Repository Layer) Tj
T*
(  -> H2 Database) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(Response Flow) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(H2 Database -> Repository -> Service -> REST Controller -> React UI -> User) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(Main Modules) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(- Authentication) Tj
T*
(- Dashboard) Tj
T*
(- Income and Expense Management) Tj
T*
(- Category Management) Tj
T*
(- Search and Filters) Tj
T*
(- Reports and Analytics) Tj
T*
(- CSV Export and Dark Mode) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
