BT
/F1 11 Tf
50 780 Td
14 TL
/F1 18 Tf
(Authentication and Dashboard Workflow) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(Authentication Workflow) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(1. User opens the React application.) Tj
T*
(2. User chooses Login or Register.) Tj
T*
(3. React sends credentials to the Spring Boot authentication API.) Tj
T*
(4. Backend validates registration fields or checks login password.) Tj
T*
(5. Backend returns an authentication token and user details.) Tj
T*
(6. React stores the session in browser local storage.) Tj
T*
(7. Protected API calls include the token in the X-Auth-Token header.) Tj
T*
(8. User can log out, which clears the token.) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(Dashboard Workflow) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(1. User logs in successfully.) Tj
T*
(2. React calls the dashboard API.) Tj
T*
(3. Backend loads the user's transactions.) Tj
T*
(4. Service layer calculates total income, expenses, balance, monthly income,) Tj
T*
(   monthly expenses, and recent transactions.) Tj
T*
(5. React displays summary cards, recent transactions, and charts.) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(Dashboard Outputs) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(- Total Income) Tj
T*
(- Total Expenses) Tj
T*
(- Current Balance) Tj
T*
(- Monthly Summary) Tj
T*
(- Recent Transactions) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
