/F1 11 Tf
50 780 Td
14 TL
/F1 18 Tf
(Category and Transaction Workflow) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(Category Management Workflow) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(1. User opens the Categories page.) Tj
T*
(2. React fetches all categories for the logged-in user.) Tj
T*
(3. User creates, edits, or deletes a category.) Tj
T*
(4. Backend validates category name and category type.) Tj
T*
(5. Backend saves changes through JPA repositories.) Tj
T*
(6. React refreshes the category list.) Tj
T*
(7. Categories used by transactions are protected from deletion.) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(Transaction Management Workflow) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(1. User opens the Transactions page.) Tj
T*
(2. React fetches categories and transaction records.) Tj
T*
(3. User adds income or expense with amount, category, date, description,) Tj
T*
(   and recurring flag.) Tj
T*
(4. Backend validates amount, date, category ownership, and category type.) Tj
T*
(5. Backend stores the transaction in the database.) Tj
T*
(6. User can edit or delete existing transactions.) Tj
T*
(7. Dashboard and reports update after changes.) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(Transaction Types) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(- INCOME) Tj
T*
(- EXPENSE) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
