/F1 18 Tf
(Search, Filter, Reports, and Analytics Workflow) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(Search and Filter Workflow) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(1. User enters a search term or selects filters.) Tj
T*
(2. Filters can include date range, category, and transaction type.) Tj
T*
(3. React sends query parameters to the transactions API.) Tj
T*
(4. Backend applies filters in the repository query.) Tj
T*
(5. React displays the matching transactions.) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(Reports and Analytics Workflow) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(1. User opens the Reports page.) Tj
T*
(2. User selects a date range.) Tj
T*
(3. React calls the reports API.) Tj
T*
(4. Backend groups transaction data into monthly expenses, category-wise) Tj
T*
(   expenses, and income vs expense totals.) Tj
T*
(5. React renders pie and bar charts.) Tj
T*
(6. User can export report data to CSV.) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 13 Tf
(Report Types) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(- Monthly Expense Report) Tj
T*
(- Category-wise Expense Report) Tj
T*
(- Income vs Expense Report) Tj
T*
(- Date Range Report) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
